      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source first.Now I have a clear picture of the original test. I'll improve understandability by:\n1. Removing all unused imports, fields, and methods\n2. Extracting a helper method to eliminate repetitive encode-and-assert boilerplate\n3. Using inline byte-array literals to reduce noise\n4. Grouping the cases with clearer commentsThe improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version eliminates all unused imports, fields, and helper methods, extracts a `assertToAsciiChars` helper to remove the repetitive encode-and-assert boilerplate, and uses inline byte-array literals with clear section comments to make the progression of bit-setting immediately apparent."
    }
